data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### 5e9009de-43b4-5998-82ae-95f6d76a66c3\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/getting-started.mdx#L32-L32\n\n```\nGetting Started [Get started with viem in just a few lines of code.] › Quick Start\n```\n\n### dd0a7780-ce34-5d9d-8cf7-85763fed3a0d\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/getting-started.mdx#L1-L1\n\n```\nGetting Started [Get started with viem in just a few lines of code.]\n```\n\n### 5318bd5a-4c42-5726-98cb-57b3aeb4c484\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/getting-started.mdx#L14-L30\n\n```\nGetting Started [Get started with viem in just a few lines of code.] › Installation\n:::code-group\n\n```bash [npm]\nnpm i viem\n```\n\n```bash [pnpm]\npnpm i viem\n```\n\n```bash [bun]\nbun i viem\n```\n\n:::\n```\n\n### 39ac0bb4-dc09-5390-ad89-fdc5f53ce65b\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/getting-started.mdx#L62-L68\n\n```\nGetting Started [Get started with viem in just a few lines of code.] › Quick Start › 2. Consume Actions\nconst client = createPublicClient({\n  chain: mainnet,\n  transport: http(),\n})\n\nconst blockNumber = await client.getBlockNumber() // [!code focus]\n```\n```\n\n### 53189a49-51d4-59e4-9c00-338a0b800b98\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/getting-started.mdx#L53-L55\n\n```\nGetting Started [Get started with viem in just a few lines of code.] › Quick Start › 2. Consume Actions\nNow that you have a Client set up, you can now interact with Ethereum and consume [Actions](/docs/actions/public/introduction)!\n```\n\n### 2ddb4309-255e-583d-b192-cfba74b27801\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/getting-started.mdx#L34-L36\n\n```\nGetting Started [Get started with viem in just a few lines of code.] › Quick Start › 1. Set up your Client & Transport\nFirstly, set up your [Client](/docs/clients/intro) with a desired [Transport](/docs/clients/intro) & [Chain](/docs/chains/introduction).\n```\n\n### 1e009c6c-eaf9-5b11-8eda-1ce06c9f2033\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/glossary/errors.md#L62-L62\n\n```\nErrors [Glossary of Errors in viem.] › Contract › `RawContractError`\n```\n\n### 40787796-d60e-57e5-b616-a809efefe778\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/getting-started.mdx#L70-L72\n\n```\nGetting Started [Get started with viem in just a few lines of code.] › Live example\n<iframe className=\"mt-6\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600px\" frameBorder=\"0\" src=\"https://stackblitz.com/edit/viem-getting-started?embed=1&file=index.ts&hideNavigation=1&hideDevTools=true&terminalHeight=1&hideExplorer=1&dev…\n```\n\n### f8ee5a27-2486-5e5b-84c7-3c5e9d9f2b1b\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/w